    intro: "Two small jobs tonight. First, pointing: Japanese sorts 'this and that' by who is closest — これ near me, それ near you, あれ over there. Second, shopping: how to ask どこ (where) and いくら (how much), and the four words that work at any counter in Japan — これを ください.",
